// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118550005 |Number concentration (property) (qualifier value)| OR 705056007 |Logarithmic number concentration (property) (qualifier value)| OR 118569000 |Arbitrary concentration (property) (qualifier value)| OR 762918005 |Logarithmic arbitrary concentration (property) (qualifier value)|), 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = << 117174000 |Nucleic acid sequence with relative specificity for microorganism (substance)|, 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = << 1156878000 |Molecular nucleic acid amplification technique (qualifier value)|"
